  <h2 style="color: Black; text-align: center;">Educational Organisations Management System (EOMS)</h2>
		<p style="font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;">
		We at PDEA's Baburaoji Gholap College, Sangvi, Pune, build a legacy to impart Quality Education through a curriculum that nurtures a community of thinkers and compassionate global citizens.
		</p>
		<p style="font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;">
		We shall strive to create a purpose for learning, imbibe a sense of responsibility with enthusiasm and balance a strong learning, living and work ethos.
		<br>
		<b style="font-size: 16px;">We are committed to satisfy :-</b> 
		</p>
		<ul>
		    <li style="font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;">
		    &#9755; All Applicable requirements of Governing bodies 
		    </li>
		    <li style="font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;">
		    &#9755; Social responsibility 
		    </li>
		    <li style="font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;">
		    &#9755; Management of intellectual property
		    </li>
		    <li style="font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;">
		    &#9755; Requirements of learners and other interested parties'
		    </li>
		</ul>
		<p style="font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: black;">
		This shall be achieved through continual improvement in Educational organization Management System.
		</p>
